<title>LATVIA: Latvian trade deficit Jan-April 169.93 mln lats.</title>
<headline>Latvian trade deficit Jan-April 169.93 mln lats.</headline>
<dateline>RIGA 1997-06-16</dateline>
<text>
<p>Latvia's trade deficit in real prices rose to 169.93 million lats in the first four months of the year from 150.45 million lats in the same period of 1996. the statistics committee said on Monday.</p>
<p>All figures in millions of lats</p>
<p> LATVIAN TRADE     Jan-April '97   Jan-March '97   Jan-April '96</p>
<p> Exports	     293.91	    209.01	    237.84</p>
<p> Imports	     457.85	    320.71	    388.29</p>
<p> Balance	     -169.93	   -111.70	   -150.45</p>
<p>Major trade partners</p>
<p>EXPORTS (pct of total vs same period last year)</p>
<p>Russia  20.2 (26)</p>
<p>U.K.    16.4 (10)</p>
<p>Germany 13.6 (13.5)</p>
<p>IMPORTS (pct of total vs same period last year)</p>
<p>Russia  17.7 (21.7)</p>
<p>Germany 14.8 (13.7)</p>
<p>Finland 9.3 (9.2)</p>
<p>-- Riga newsroom, +371 721 5240</p>
